<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Wizlist</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>wizlist</a>
</pre>
<p>Shows the list of the immortals of the game, the gods who run and build 
it, as the administrators keep it. To see which of them are online now, 
use <a cmd='#'>who</a>. For those who ruled Valhalla in years gone by, see 
<a cmd='#'>Help Past Gods</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Immortal</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Past Gods</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Who</a>
</pre>




</div>